// ============================================================================
//  galChat.Items  —  the conversation, oldest-first (newest at the bottom).
//  Control: a blank VERTICAL gallery "galChat" inside conPercyChat:
//        X=16  Y=72  Width=336  Height=380   TemplatePadding=2
//        (set the gallery to flexible / auto height, and put one AutoHeight
//         "HTML text" control htmlBubble inside — see htmlBubble.HtmlText.powerfx)
//  Each row is { Seq, Role ("user"/"percy"), Body }.
// ============================================================================
Sort( colChat, Seq )
